vies-youve-watched-this-week-iii/210398","site":"T Nation · 4744 posts · 2015"},{"title":"Velvet's Lifting and Other Fun Stuff Log","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/velvets-lifting-and-other-fun-stuff-log/234025","site":"T Nation · 3086 posts · 2017"},{"title":"Trump: The Third Year","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/trump-the-third-year/250592","site":"T Nation · 2626 posts · 2019"},{"title":"Brute's Book","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/brutes-book/210950","site":"T Nation · 2469 posts · 2015"},{"title":"Show Off Your Pets","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/show-off-your-pets/260435","site":"T Nation · 1556 posts · 2019"},{"title":"POP! Goes the Democrat!","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/pop-goes-the-democrat/255811","site":"T Nation · 1444 posts · 2019"},{"title":"When Does a \"Fake\" Pandemic Become \"Real\"?","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/when-does-a-fake-pandemic-become-real/267846","site":"T Nation · 1281 posts · 2020"},{"title":"NBA Free Agency/Offseason","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/nba-free-agency-offseason/150933","site":"T Nation · 1120 posts · 2010"},{"title":"Calvert and Milo Barbell","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/calvert-and-milo-barbell/283008","site":"T Nation · 837 posts · 2023"},{"title":"Our Department Is Being Defunded","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/our-department-is-being-defunded/273552","site":"T Nation · 798 posts · 2021"},{"title":"Loganator's Log: Back to My Roots","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/loganators-log-back-to-my-roots/237439","site":"T Nation · 778 posts · 2018"}],"news":[],"social":[],"web":[{"title":"Wall angels — Grokipedia","url":"https://grokipedia.com/page/Wall_angels"},{"title":"Forward head posture (Wikipedia)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Forward_head_posture"}]},"angle":{"goal":"Posture","effect":"indirect","chain":["Arm slides against wall","Upper back and shoulder mobility","More upright, open posture"],"text":"Wall angels are used in posture routines to improve shoulder and upper-back mobility, giving a straighter, more open stance. The drill is common in rehab and fitness; no appearance trials were found."},"wikipedia":null,"grokipedia":"https://grokipedia.com/page/Wall_angels","lead":["Wall angels, also called wall slides or the V-to-W stretch, are a standing bodyweight exercise in which the arms are slid up and down a wall while the head, upper back, buttocks, elbows and hands stay in contact with it [1].","Grokipedia, an AI-generated encyclopedia, describes them as part of physical therapy, Pilates and postural routines meant to counter rounded shoulders and shortened chest muscles from sitting and desk work, and says they target shoulder mobility, scapular stability and thoracic flexibility [1]. Those descriptions are not backed in the source by clinical trials, and no study of wall angels specifically was found."],"infobox":[["Type","Bodyweight mobility drill"],["Also called","Wall slides, V to W stretch, standing snow angels"],["Equipment","A flat wall"],["Muscles described","Rhomboids, trapezius, deltoids, serratus anterior, rotator cuff; stretches pectorals [1]"]],"sections":[{"h":"Description","paras":["The starting position places the elbows bent near 90 degrees in a W shape against the wall; the arms then slide overhead toward a V shape and return under control, with the aim of keeping continuous contact at every point [1]. Fitness descriptions recommend slow movement and a reduced range for people with limited mobility, and suggest a small pillow behind the head where forward head posture prevents the head touching the wall [1]."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Clinical studies","paras":["No studies found."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Related background","paras":["Wikipedia notes that forward head posture, often combined with rounded shoulders, is common among device users and that proposed remedies include strengthening mid-back muscles and scapular retractors and thoracic mobilization; it also flags several of its treatment statements as needing better sourcing [2]."],"subs":[]}],"lore":null,"timeline":[],"refs":[{"title":"Wall angels (Grokipedia)","url":"https://grokipedia.com/page/Wall_angels","source":"Grokipedia","year":2026,"type":"encyclopedia"},{"title":"Forward head posture (Wikipedia)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Forward_head_posture","source":"Wikipedia","year":2026,"type":"encyclopedia"}],"studies":[],"reddit":[],"forums":[{"title":"Flame Free Confession III: Even More Flame Free (Part 1)","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/flame-free-confession-iii-even-more-flame-free-part-1/264067","site":"T Nation · 10000 posts · 2020"},{"title":"The Stupid Thread 2 (Part 1)","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/the-stupid-thread-2-part-1/219703","site":"T Nation · 9999 posts · 2016"},{"title":"Trump 2025 - Resuming The National Nightmare Of Peace And Prosperity (Part 1)","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/trump-2025-resuming-the-national-nightmare-of-peace-and-prosperity-part-1/289108","site":"T Nation · 9998 posts · 2024"},{"title":"The Tactical Life","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/the-tactical-life/232312","site":"T Nation · 5251 posts · 2017"},{"title":"The Return of Even More Movies You've Watched This Week III","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/the-return-of-even-more-movies-youve-watched-this-week-iii/210398","site":"T Nation · 4744 posts · 2015"},{"title":"Velvet's Lifting and Other Fun Stuff Log","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/velvets-lifting-and-other-fun-stuff-log/234025","site":"T Nation · 3086 posts · 2017"}]}